   "title": "How this works",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Frame review\nInspect cast, style and expected visible facts before animation. Edit expected_json.state with the selected shot's visibly testable starting facts. Every requested fact needs evidence. Uncertain or malformed replies do not pass. This workflow reports evidence; the studio preserves rejected candidates without promoting them.\n\nAI mode: Normal uses Gemma 4 12B at 8-bit; Fast uses E4B. Change the Open Cinema Writer mode widget. Image and video models stay the same. Cast-review findings retain the saved candidate; inspect it before using it downstream."
   ],
